{"schema_version":1,"page_number":25,"blocks":[{"type":"markdown","content":"\n\n第 3 章 数据的集中趋势和离散程度\n\n### 3.5 用计算器求方差\n\n我们也可以用计算器来计算一组数据的平均数、方差。\n\n甲、乙两人在相同条件下 10\n\n次射击的成绩如下(单位：环)：\n\n甲：10，7，8，8，8，8，8，\n\n8，9，6；\n\n乙：8，8，8，8，5，8，8，\n\n9，9，9.\n\n\n\n用计算器计算这两组数据的平均数、方差，比较甲、乙两人射击成绩的稳定性。\n\n方法一：\n\n按开机键 ON 后，首先将计算器功能模式设定为统计模式，\n\n依次按键：\n\n\n\n\n\n显示结果为 8.\n\n显示结果为 1.\n\n即甲射击成绩的平均数  "},{"type":"formula","latex":"\\bar{x}=8","display":false},{"type":"markdown","content":"，方差  "},{"type":"formula","latex":"s^{2}=1","display":false},{"type":"markdown","content":"。\n\n依次按键：\n\n\n\n\n\n显示结果为 8.\n\n显示结果为 1.2.\n\n即乙射击成绩的平均数  "},{"type":"formula","latex":"\\bar{x}=8","display":false},{"type":"markdown","content":"，方差  "},{"type":"formula","latex":"s^{2}=1.2","display":false},{"type":"markdown","content":"。\n\n118"},{"type":"visual_region","bbox":{"left":554,"top":233,"right":841,"bottom":375},"source_order":0},{"type":"visual_region","bbox":{"left":105,"top":531,"right":188,"bottom":649},"source_order":1},{"type":"visual_region","bbox":{"left":206,"top":529,"right":851,"bottom":684},"source_order":2},{"type":"visual_region","bbox":{"left":356,"top":720,"right":864,"bottom":752},"source_order":3},{"type":"visual_region","bbox":{"left":199,"top":766,"right":354,"bottom":794},"source_order":4}],"termination":"eos","warnings":[]}